# Testing

Long-form: `.agents/rules/testing.md`

- Runner: **Vitest** (not Jest). Setup: `src/test-setup.ts`.
- Colocate under `__tests__/` or `*.test.ts(x)` / `*.spec.ts(x)`.
- RBAC: `setRbacEnabled` from `shared/lib/rbac` when toggling checks in tests.
- Prefer RTL + user-event; mock network at service/query boundary.
- Coverage excludes many pages/routes — check `vite.config.ts` before assuming CI thresholds.
- Do not use `jest.fn`, `--testPathPattern`, or ESLint test scripts from stale docs.
